ckground: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>接缝放在会变的地方</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>三层同心接缝按「变化轴」裁接口，不是随手按类名切</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>统一注入点</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>所有能力走同一个注入点</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>进程内护栏</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>两阶段绑定 · 失效保护 · 失败即拦</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>35 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
